{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Screen a surety book of principals"},"description":"Screens a surety broker's book of up to 25 Railroad Commission of Texas operator numbers (principals) with the surety-book-v1 semantics: one row per principal in request order with the P-5 letter verbatim (A labelled active, D delinquent, any other letter unlabelled), claims on file, AFFECTED on the evaluation date, approaching within 24 months, the Commission-published cost proxy with the priced claim count and the rate label read from the publication's cost_rate_basis (a fiscal year's Commission rates, or the publication's own label verbatim when it establishes no table year), unpriced claims, the Full Wellbore flagged counts (a cross-check only) and the 16 TAC \u00a73.78 blanket floor from inactive wells only (a lower bound, not a bond amount). Book totals are given only where a sum is valid; unpriced claims and the floors are NOT_SUMMED, with the reason. Wellbores two principals of the book both claim are disclosed with the claims and cost the totals count more than once. A principal not in the publication refuses the whole book rather than leave a row out.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"operator_numbers":{"description":"1-25 six-digit Railroad Commission of Texas operator numbers as strings, each once (e.g. [\"276959\", \"760218\"]). The rows keep this order.","items":{"description":"Six-digit Railroad Commission of Texas operator number, with leading zeros (e.g. 276959).","pattern":"^\\d{6}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":25,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["operator_numbers"],"type":"object"},"name":"screen_book","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"blanket_floor_note":{"const":"The 16 TAC \u00a73.78(g)(1)(B) blanket base amount for the inactive wellbores the file attributes to the operator alone. A lower bound (total wells unknown), not a bond amount.","type":"string"},"boundary":{"const":"Screening results are cost proxies. They are not ARO, not legal determinations, not bond amounts. Production, legal and financial reliance are on HOLD.","type":"string"},"cost_note":{"const":"A principal with no priced claim has no figure, not zero. Unpriced claims have no dollar figure.","type":"string"},"count_unit":{"const":"operator_wellbore","type":"string"},"evaluation_date":{"type":"string"},"format_version":{"const":"surety-book-v1","type":"string"},"full_wellbore_crosscheck_note":{"type":"string"},"iwar_as_of":{"type":"string"},"overlap":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"claims_counted_again":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"cost_counted_again":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"usd":{"type":"number"},"usd_cents":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"usd_display":{"type":"string"}},"required":["usd_cents","usd","usd_display"],"type":"object"},"note":{"type":"string"},"shared_wellbores":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"api":{"type":"string"},"link":{"type":"string"},"operator_numbers":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}},"required":["api","operator_numbers","link"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"shared_wellbores_listed":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"wellbores":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"}},"required":["wellbores","claims_counted_again","cost_counted_again","shared_wellbores","shared_wellbores_listed","note"],"type":"object"},"p5_note":{"const":"p5_letter_verbatim is the IWAR P5 Originating Status letter, verbatim. Labelled per RRC P-5 manual: A active, D delinquent; any other letter is not labelled.","type":"string"},"principals":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"publication":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"attestation_pinned":{"type":"